{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2021-04", "window": 2, "start_date": 1617840000, "end_date": 1618531199, "month_true_total": 123, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 21:54:59 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "90357468", "author": {"steamid": "76561198858727125", "personaname": "notsmart", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198858727125/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 17257, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3020, "last_played": 1787178144, "avatar": "9135bfd3478019f5e49d759440090e702c3ad62e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Modding this game is pain in the ass, launch the game on steam, exit, then launch it on the crappy EA launcher,  EXIT and THEN launching the game again on mod manager and hoping you won´t get an error. Mods aside, Andromeda, altho the weakest game in the franchise, is actually really enjoyable, both for the story and the gameplay, ignoring the animations smh.", "timestamp_created": 1618502022, "timestamp_updated": 1712821866, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "90349931", "author": {"steamid": "76561198032927427", "personaname": "Benjani", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/benjani023/", "num_games_owned": 386, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 844, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 831, "last_played": 1769023485, "avatar": "4efe1e4699f427f3dac9a9bf9d66c9968d91db66"}, "language": "english", "review": "I've completed on Xbox once before so my total playtime is higher. I enjoyed it the first time round, maybe with rose tinted glasses owing that a new Mass Effect game was released. Upon replaying the original trilogy and going back to this to replay I can't bring myself to play it any further past the point I am. It just feels like a generic space game filled with fetch quests with a Mass Effect skin slapped on it to generate extra £££", "timestamp_created": 1618492369, "timestamp_updated": 1724845298, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "90338050", "author": {"steamid": "76561198030790124", "personaname": "Emmo8", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198030790124/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 4856, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2007, "last_played": 1738911746, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "super fun", "timestamp_created": 1618472521, "timestamp_updated": 1618472521, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "90331747", "author": {"steamid": "76561197960420442", "personaname": "emspa", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/spanto/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 79, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 46, "last_played": 1618509770, "avatar": "de29aaa5877b774865ff28ff6b58dd6d7f5c87c6"}, "language": "english", "review": "I tried to give this game a fair shot, but my first attempt to play it was met with an infinitely long loading screen before I even got to the first menu. On my second launch I was able to play until I entered the atmosphere of the first planet, where I was stuck in what seemed to be a 'hidden loading screen' as our ship burned for ten minutes before I restarted the game and met the same fate again.", "timestamp_created": 1618458575, "timestamp_updated": 1618458575, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.491159796714782715", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "90321853", "author": {"steamid": "76561198206121076", "personaname": "Zediker1995", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198206121076/", "num_games_owned": 513, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 11572, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 635, "last_played": 1648578897, "avatar": "4f7bcfd19d6cfaec1b48a8d5b6512100e46b3059"}, "language": "english", "review": "Honestly this game is GREAT, just make sure you look at it as a seperate series from the trilogy. the combat is fluid, the skills are diverse, the story as a standalone is good (cheesy sometimes). the companions are interesting and have unique personalities. \n\nhits all the marks as an RPG game for me.\n\nmultiplayer is weak, but its cool that they tried i suppose!", "timestamp_created": 1618439495, "timestamp_updated": 1618439495, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 16, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.533248782157897949", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 4, "count": 1}]}]}